<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-hospĭtālis</span></b> ,
			e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>inhospitable.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Caucasus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 22, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Pan. 34</span></i>
			
			<i>ext.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regnum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Troad. 215</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pontus Euxinus antea ab inhospitali feritate
					Axenos appellatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. H. N. 6 praef.</span></i>
			 § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">1.—Of a tree that does not admit of
					ingrafting: duritia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 14, 24, § 104</span></i>
			.— <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inhospĭtālĭter</span></b> ,
				<i>inhospitably</i>, <i><span class="en">Tert.
				adv. Marc. 4, 24</span></i>.</div>
